==Notes==
* A shuriken's damage is unaffected by its wielder's [[strength]] unless given an explicit [[mighty]] property. So characters with less than 10 strength will not have a damage penalty when wielding most shurikens. In this respect, shurikens behave like [[crossbow]]s, not like the other thrown weapons ([[throwing axe]] and [[dart]]).
* Shurikens can be used with [[shield]]s.

==Toolset==
* Shurikens are listed in the [[throwing blueprint category]] on the [[item palette]] of the [[toolset]].